{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1373418-playing-a-lycian-as-a-full-fledged-player-character","id":1373418,"title":"Playing a Lycian as a full-fledged Player Character","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-07T12:08:17-08:00","id":1373418,"title":"Playing a Lycian as a full-fledged Player Character","content":"In a server game I'm in, Lycians are permitted, and I am interested in giving one a test run.<br /> However, many of the ideas appear to be more suitable as NPC/quest encounters rather than full-fledged PCs.<br /> The game is set in Vegas, and I was considering a &quot;City Father&quot; archetype of a sort. A Quixotic Chimera that appears as a mobster in a suit, whose guise is &quot;The City of Sin&quot; meaning items that symbolize Vegas itself (I am considering the &quot;Welcome to Fabulous Las Vegas Sign&quot;), who would act as a sort of tour guide/proprietor of the spirit of sin and revelry.<br /> Alternately, an abandoned animatronic.<br /> <br /> Has anyone here had any success or advice on how to play as a Lycian, especially if integrated into a cross-splat game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25625-magicjuggler","name":"MagicJuggler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25625_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-07T04:37:37-07:00","id":1379228,"title":"","content":"I want to try something like that, or have them open as Characters for players that can't make it every game. They seem to be a replacement for the Inanimae till we get rules for them.<br /> <br /> But a thread I will eventually start if no one beats me to it is one dedicated to coming up with different redes. We need to expand their Repertoire both for PCs and NPCs. I want to have Godlike Chimerical Dragons and Quixotic Chimera with connections to the Parthenon or Pok\u00e9mon Go making a Psychic Mewtwo demigod when it first was introduced.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-16T10:28:09-07:00","id":1381946,"title":"","content":"I've tinkered with it, but have not had the chance to play a Lycian yet. Personally I would love to play one. Pondering a Lycian called the &quot;Sock Scarfer,&quot; embodiment of the idea that socks magically disappear. &quot;He&quot; appears as a roughly humanoid creature made of discarded socks. <br /> <img src=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn%3AANd9GcQj0d9C0bdh8BKJpYnuZUdVJUoPqlk4ei2QqCr3PgSAtEA0tp99&amp;usqp=CAU\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=